{"content": "That is when a soldier arrives to report that both Titans were somehow killed. Everyone rushes to the place just to find evaporating skeletons of two Titans, much to Hange's agony. Apparently, the culprit is a soldier who then used omni-directional mobility gear to escape, as Eld and Gunther note, as well as a lookout. Oluo then comments on Hange's agony much to the disgust of Petra, who nudges him. Eren begins to wonder how it happened, but Levi tells Eren that they should go now since the Military Police will take care of it. Erwin then approaches Eren and asks him about what he can see there and who is the enemy. This leaves Eren confused, so Erwin apologizes for asking odd questions and leaves.\n\nMembers of a religious organization that proselytizes within the Walls. They worship the Walls as God, refusing to allow any changes to them, even for defensive purposes.\n\nSince Wall Maria's fall, their numbers have rapidly increased, as has their influence.", "chunk_index": 4, "source_url": "https://attackontitan.fandom.com/wiki/Special_Operations_Squad:_Eve_of_the_Counterattack,_Part_2", "source_title": "Special Operations Squad: Eve of the Counterattack, Part 2", "source_type": "episode", "episode_number": 15, "entity": null, "reveal_episode": 15, "embedding": [-0.038210429251194, 0.11787836998701096, 0.004095188807696104, 0.06487108767032623, 0.07760677486658096, 0.006189763080328703, 0.08484560251235962, 0.0634225457906723, 0.03899919241666794, -0.09802893549203873, -0.012375799007713795, -0.01307707466185093, 0.03472462669014931, -0.03854987025260925, -0.024318015202879906, -0.03210240975022316, -0.11508241295814514, 0.035802505910396576, -0.012736183591187, 0.030492503196001053, 0.013231486082077026, 0.045585695654153824, 0.03148112818598747, 0.06412938237190247, 0.009796696715056896, -0.03884510695934296, -0.010999731719493866, -0.04896710813045502, 0.015178242698311806, -0.05581739544868469, 0.03625672683119774, -0.025845257565379143, -0.0372379